@startuml
title Cyber AI - Auth Collaboration Diagram

actor "User" as User
rectangle "ChatWorkspace" as UI
rectangle "useAuth" as Auth
database "Supabase" as DB

User -> UI : 1: open app
UI -> Auth : 2: get session
Auth --> UI : 3: session token

User -> UI : 4: sign out
UI -> Auth : 5: signOut()
Auth -> DB : 6: logout
DB --> Auth : 7: ok
Auth --> UI : 8: session cleared
UI --> User : 9: redirect to login

note right of Auth
  Session management and
  persistence are handled here.
end note
@enduml
